Title: India GST invoice processing
Goal template: Turn supplier invoice emails from the AP mailbox into a reviewable India GST extraction with per-field citations and GST validations, match the supplier and purchase order against Zoho Books, create one purchase bill after any required human approval, and archive the source document. Request: {request}

